[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800400_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800400_01_0001","text":"主持人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800400_01_0010","text":"好厉害啊，冬优子酱！\n不管什么服装都能完美驾驭呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800400_01_0020","text":"嘿嘿\n哪有────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800400_01_0030","text":"没有那回事啦——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800400_01_0040","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800400_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800400_01_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800400_01_0060","text":"辛苦了，冬优子\n你表现得很好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800400_01_0070","text":"……有人注意到了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800400_01_0080","text":"不，看起来没问题\n果然厉害"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800400_01_0090","text":"啊啊，真是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800400_01_0100","text":"……偏偏在这种日子\n落枕什么的……！"}]
